@startuml
!include ../_shared/sequence-styles.iuml

title SQ-0009: Manage Products
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin <<Content Manager>>
participant "Admin API" as API <<Orchestrator>>
database "PostgreSQL" as DB <<Persistence>>

Admin -> API: Create Product(DTO)
activate API
    API -> API: Validate Data
    API -> DB: Insert Product
    activate DB
    DB --> API: ProductID
    deactivate DB
    API -> DB: Insert Variants
    API --> Admin: Created (201)
deactivate API

Admin -> API: Update Product(ID, DTO)
activate API
    API -> DB: Update Fields
    activate DB
    DB --> API: Success
    deactivate DB
    API --> Admin: Updated (200)
deactivate API

Admin -> API: Delete Product(ID)
activate API
    API -> DB: Soft Delete (is_deleted=true)
    activate DB
    DB --> API: Success
    deactivate DB
    API --> Admin: Deleted (204)
deactivate API

@enduml
